   "phrasing": "waitlike_05",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Of course. That's fine, and honestly helpful. Be upfront about any debts or habits, it builds trust.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
